!Name: p90forwmwss
!C A period 90 c/3 forward MWSS rake.
!C This shoots a period 90 MWSS stream which travels ahead of the puffer.
!C This works by taking a forwards period 90 LWSS rake, and converting each
!C of the LWSS's into MWSS's using two period 90 sideways MWSS rakes.  The
!C conversion involving three LWSS's into a MWSS was found by Dieter Leithner.
!C This is an improvement on a previous version of the rake.
!C David I. Bell, November 2002
!Source: jslife-moving
!
